  "translation": "Na Eliab, brata bilong en i bikpela man, i harim tok bilong en long ol manmeri, na bel bilong Eliab i bit na i taet long David, na em i tok: Bilong wanem yu kam daun, na long husat yu lusim dispela liklik ol sipsip na meme long wail ples? Mi save ⟨את⟩ praud bilong yu na ⟨את⟩ nogut bilong bel bilong yu — bilong wanem, long lukim pait yu kam daun.",
